{
  "name": "Hats",
  "icon": "cyberhats:straw_hat",
  "category": "cyberfarm:drone_systems",
  "sortnum": 20,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Hats do nothing at all, and look good doing it. $(l)You$() can wear one, and so can your drones: a drone folds its antenna away and wears the hat on its tank, clear of every module.$(br2)Some hats move: the propeller spins, tassels and tips sway, the halo floats."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(li)$(l)Wear a hat$(): right-click with it, or put it in your helmet slot.$(br)$(li)$(l)Over a helmet$(): put it in the Hat slot right of you in the inventory. The helmet still protects you; the eye above the slot hides the hat."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(li)$(l)On a drone$(): right-click the drone with the hat.$(br)$(li)$(l)Take it off$(): right-click the drone with Shears.$(br2)A drone you pick up drops its hat. Armor stands can wear hats too. With Curios or Cosmetic Armor there is no Hat slot: their cosmetic slots take hats."
    },
    {
